Package: sentra-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Sentra <sentra@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), adduser | passwd, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/Snowwiy/Sentra
Description: Sentra endpoint monitoring agent
 Reports heartbeat, telemetry, inventory and events of this host to a Sentra server.
 Runs as the unprivileged system user sentra-agent under the systemd service
 sentra-agent. After installing, enroll it with a one-time token:
   sudo sentra-agent-setup --server http://SERVER:8000 --token-file ./enrollment.token
